    "summary": "A checkbox for an independent yes/no choice that takes effect later, usually when a form is submitted. For a setting that applies immediately, use `CabSwitch`. Group related checkboxes in a `<fieldset>` with a `<legend>`.",
    "pattern": "[WAI-ARIA APG: Checkbox](https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/checkbox/), built on a native `<input type=\"checkbox\">` so role, state and form submission come from the browser. The visible box is decorative and hidden from assistive tech.",
